。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"44":{"step":[[44,45,""]],"type":1,"name":["波蒂埃","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"612500830","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["什么？狗？","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"45":{"step":[[45,46,""]],"type":1,"name":["神秘学警察Ⅰ","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"632001.png","audio":"612500458","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["是啊，然后又是那老一套，说我们的人都是些搞不清楚状况的愣头青。<br>接着当然少不了那个我们耳朵都听出茧子来的例子——","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"46":{"step":[[46,47,""]],"type":1,"name":["神秘学警察Ⅱ","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"632002.png","audio":"612500525","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["一年前，一名年轻的警员把一个孩子身上留下的中式按摩痕迹，误以为是虐待的伤痕通报了儿童保护组织，险些害那对可怜的父母失去抚养权……","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"47":{"step":[[47,48,""]],"type":1,"name":["神秘学警察Ⅱ","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"632002.png","audio":"612500526","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["那件事上我们的人的确不够谨慎，但误会很快得到了澄清，那个年轻人也亲自登门道歉得到了原谅，不知道他一个无关人员还在耿耿于怀什么。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"48":{"step":[[48,49,""]],"type":1,"name":["神秘学警察Ⅰ","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"632001.png","audio":"612500459","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["但我猜那件事就是他看我们科不顺眼的契机，因为这次他根本投诉错地方了。找狗这种事就不归我们管，找魔精才归。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"49":{"step":[[49,50,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["他们对视了一眼，叹了口气。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"50":{"step":[[50,51,""]],"type":1,"name":["波蒂埃","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"612500831","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["……我只能说，我很庆幸并不是所有的市民都是这样的。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"51":{"step":[[51,52,""]],"type":1,"name":["波蒂埃","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"612500832","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["来吧，今天有什么好消息吗？","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"52":{"step":[[52,53,""]],"type":1,"name":["神秘学警察Ⅰ","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"632001.png","audio":"612500460","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["遗憾。只有坏消息。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"53":{"step":[[53,54,""]],"type":1,"name":["波蒂埃","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"612500833","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["……那家伙又动手了？","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"54":{"step":[[54,55,""]],"type":0,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"55":{"step":[[55,56,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["今晨的报纸被递到了她的眼前。<br>在看清最上面格外醒目的标题后，手中咖啡的香气似乎也不再诱人了。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"56":{"step":[[56,57,""]],"type":1,"name":["波蒂埃","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"630411.png","audio":"612500834","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["“正义的英雄‘针人’现身洛杉矶？恶人再次得到审判”……那些媒体还是这么喜欢夸大其词。这次又是什么人？","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"57":{"step":[[57,58,""]],"type":1,"name":["神秘学警察Ⅰ","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"632001.png","audio":"612500461","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["一伙富家公子哥为了取乐，把自己的队友弄进了重症监控室，结果连拘留室都没进，派去的警察直接被老爹们安排的律师请回去了。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"58":{"step":[[58,59,""]],"type":1,"name":["神秘学警察Ⅱ","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"632002.png","audio":"612500527","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["今天早上，他们被发现叫人钉在了学校体育场的围栏上……<br>别说打球了，大概下半辈子都要和轮椅拐杖