false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["埃尔登警长的脸色会告诉你答案。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"67":{"step":[[67,68,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["波蒂埃疑惑地望向角落的警长办公室，透过半开的百叶窗观察屋内的情形。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"68":{"step":[[68,69,""]],"type":1,"name":["波蒂埃","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"612500837","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["……我的天呐！上一次埃尔登的脸变成这个颜色，还是他发现女儿交了个瘪三男友那时候吧？","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"69":{"step":[[69,70,""]],"type":1,"name":["波蒂埃","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"612500838","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["“针人”一向神出鬼没，就算这次还是没有线索，也不必这样吧？","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"70":{"step":[[70,71,""]],"type":1,"name":["神秘学警察Ⅰ","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"632001.png","audio":"612500464","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["你有所不知……就是那个“上面”，说看我们迟迟抓不住“针人”的尾巴，所以派了个外援过来。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"71":{"step":[[71,72,""]],"type":1,"name":["神秘学警察Ⅰ","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"632001.png","audio":"612500465","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["一名来自那个夜巡特遣管理局的见习执夜人即将大驾光临，帮助我们这些没用的神秘学警察解决这座城市的麻烦。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"72":{"step":[[72,73,""]],"type":1,"name":["波蒂埃","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"612500839","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["你是说基金会的那个？<br>他们不是专门负责那些“可能造成极其严重后果”的神秘学犯罪事件的吗？","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"73":{"step":[[73,74,""]],"type":1,"name":["波蒂埃","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"612500840","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["虽然“针人”的确很棘手，但我并不认为他的危险性有那么高。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"74":{"step":[[74,75,""]],"type":1,"name":["波蒂埃","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"612500841","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["再说这是我们的城市，用不着夜巡特遣的家伙来“热心帮忙”，他们对这里了解多少——","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"75":{"step":[[75,76,""]],"type":1,"name":["波蒂埃","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"612500842","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["等等，你刚才说“见习”？","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"76":{"step":[[76,77,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["她终于意识到同僚方才的话语中有一个不该被忽视的关键词，不禁瞪大了眼睛。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"77":{"step":[[77,78,""]],"type":1,"name":["神秘学警察Ⅰ","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"632001.png","audio":"612500466","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["他们选拔新人的考核中有那么一些实习项目。<br>看起来我们这里成了给未来的超级精英练手的幼儿园了。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"78":{"step":[[78,79,""]],"type":1,"name":["波蒂埃","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"612500843","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["……这是什么新式笑话吗？","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"79":{"step":[[79,80,""]],"type":1,"name":["神秘学警察Ⅱ","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"632002.png","audio":"612500530","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["我刚听说的时候也和你一个反应。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"80":{"step":[[80,81,""]],"type":1,"name":["神秘学警察Ⅰ","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"632001.png","audio":"612500467","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["但我们的局长大人认为这是个好主意——和未来的超级精英、夜巡特遣管理局还有背后的圣洛夫基金会打好关系总不是坏事。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"81":{"step":[[81,82,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["她喝干手中的咖啡，将空杯精准地掷进一旁的垃圾桶。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"82":{"step":[[82,83,""]],"type":1,"name":["波蒂埃","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"612500844","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["怪不得埃尔登那个表情……那家伙什么时候来？有人知道那人的底细吗？","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"83":{"step":[[83,84,""]],"type":1,"name":["神秘学警察Ⅰ","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"632001.png","audio":"612500468","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["听说是个来自东方的小丫头，家里很有来头，有一头祖传的强大“密友”，也正因为这个原因被选进了夜巡特遣管理局。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"84":{"step":[[84,85,""]],"type":1,"name":["神秘学警察Ⅱ","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"632002.png","audio":"612500531","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["我很想说既然我们的新朋友通过了那场选拔，那么无论她是否靠的是祖传的好帮手，多少都能够派上些用场。但……","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"85":{"step":[[85,86,""]],"type":1,"name":["神秘学警察Ⅰ","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"632001.png","audio":"612500469","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["据可靠消息称，我们的小精英是从警校被直接挑选过去的。<br>这意味着这位援兵实际上并没有任何工作经验。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"86":{"step":[[86,87,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["波蒂埃沉默了一会儿，怒火从她的胸口熊熊燃起。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"87":{"step":[[87,88,""]],"type":1,"name":["波蒂埃","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"612500845","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["……所以你们是说，我们即将迎来的是一个刚毕业的菜鸟、一个背靠家族的世家大小姐，要来我们这里给简历镀一层金。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"88":{"step":[[88,89,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["坐在波蒂埃对面的警员嗤笑一声，刚想接话——他的目光落在波蒂埃的身后，忽然口风一转。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"